+name: acute intermittent porphyria nonerythroid variant
+def: "A subtype of acute intermittent porphyria caused by variants in HMBS exon 1, which is not expressed in erythrocytes, resulting in normal HMBS activity in erythrocytes but reduced activity of the more broadly expressed housekeeping isozyme." [https://clinicalgenome.org/affiliation/40097/, https://github.com/monarch-initiative/mondo/issues/9703]
+subset: clingen {source="MONDO:CLINGEN"}
+subset: rare
+synonym: "porphyria, acute intermittent, nonerythroid variant" EXACT [https://clinicalgenome.org/affiliation/40097/]
